---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import DisclosureNote from '../components/DisclosureNote.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Start here"
	description="Yeh Bro beginner path: creatine, protein, and pre guides plus tracked affiliate links for Australia."
>
	<article class="prose-wrap">
		<p class="eyebrow">Hub</p>
		<h1>Start here</h1>
		<p class="lede">
			New to the brand? Do this in order. Keep it boring: train, eat protein, take creatine if it fits
			your budget — skip the hype tub.
		</p>

		<DisclosureNote compact />

		<ol class="path">
			<li>
				<strong>Full beginner stack</strong> — read the order of operations first.
				<div class="path-links">
					<a href="/blog/beginner-supplement-stack-australia">Stack guide</a>
					<a href="/go/stack-beginner-sm" rel="sponsored noopener noreferrer">/go/stack-beginner-sm</a>
				</div>
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Creatine</strong> — buy guide, dose habit, water-weight myth, then a transparent mono tub.
				<div class="path-links">
					<a href="/blog/best-creatine-for-beginners-australia">Beginners</a>
					<a href="/blog/best-creatine-australia">Buy guide</a>
					<a href="/blog/how-to-dose-creatine">How to dose</a>
					<a href="/blog/creatine-for-women">Women</a>
					<a href="/blog/does-creatine-cause-bloating">Bloat / water weight</a>
					<a href="/go/creatine-bulk" rel="sponsored noopener noreferrer">/go/creatine-bulk</a>
					<a href="/go/creatine-true" rel="sponsored noopener noreferrer">/go/creatine-true</a>
				</div>
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Protein</strong> — pillar, budget maths, then WPC vs WPI if dairy is the question.
				<div class="path-links">
					<a href="/blog/best-protein-powder-australia">Protein pillar</a>
					<a href="/blog/cheapest-protein-powder-australia">Cheapest protein</a>
					<a href="/blog/whey-concentrate-vs-isolate-australia">WPC vs WPI</a>
					<a href="/go/protein-bulk" rel="sponsored noopener noreferrer">/go/protein-bulk</a>
					<a href="/go/protein-true" rel="sponsored noopener noreferrer">/go/protein-true</a>
				</div>
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Pre-workout</strong> — clear doses only. Stim-free guide uses phase-1 pre seeds until Ops
				adds a dedicated stim-free slug.
				<div class="path-links">
					<a href="/blog/caffeine-dose-training">Caffeine timing</a>
					<a href="/blog/pre-workout-without-hype">Stim pre</a>
					<a href="/blog/best-stim-free-pre-workout-australia">Stim-free</a>
					<a href="/go/pre-mn" rel="sponsored noopener noreferrer">/go/pre-mn</a>
					<a href="/go/pre-sm" rel="sponsored noopener noreferrer">/go/pre-sm</a>
				</div>
			</li>
		</ol>

		<p class="muted">
			Affiliate URLs are TODO placeholders until programs approve. Only canonical phase-1 slugs are
			wired in <code>affiliates.ts</code> — unknown <code>/go/</code> paths 404.
		</p>

		<div class="cta-row">
			<a class="btn btn-primary" href="/blog">All guides</a>
			<a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/about">About Yeh Bro</a>
		</div>
	</article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.path {
		padding-left: 1.25rem;
		margin: 2rem 0;
	}
	.path li {
		margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
	}
	.path-links {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.75rem 1rem;
		margin-top: 0.5rem;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}
</style>
